[{"client_msg_id":"439af070-221f-4b0e-aea5-01f3502b0a80","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プラグイン vimrc 境界 検索","ts":"1615367600.065400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3MYR7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"113b5ed0-c22e-47f7-b7d6-07bd11e9f8b2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど","ts":"1615361716.064800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HNB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8494deb4-8678-42b3-aa10-01820d9689ea","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"「仕事中に Vim プラグインを作らない」という自分ルールを課しています。なので「vimrc に関数追加して機能追加する」程度であれば仕事の範囲内です。","ts":"1615358237.064400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KuqV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91bc2f84-943f-4666-99a4-681a12e26450","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/13049\u003e","ts":"1615354700.062600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: [LSP] 'textDocument/didChange' is always sending full buffer, content-ranges would be more efficient · Issue #13049 · neovim/neovim","id":1,"title":"[LSP] 'textDocument/didChange' is always sending full buffer, content-ranges would be more efficient · Issue #13049 · neovim/neovim","title_link":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/13049","text":"Hello Neovim LSP team, Spawning this request from a discussion had over at completion.nvim, specifically this post of mine. As I have noted a few times, I am an LSC user, but I am also dipping my t...","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6471485?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/13049","original_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/13049"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qEO9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5f45cd7-0a21-4307-bd5c-ce7afc68c982","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうですね。一部のユーザがいうには、nvim-lsp より vim-lsc のほうが早いんだが。。。という issue が上がっていたりするレベルでした。","ts":"1615354657.062200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VK44z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c86c3e9c-6b48-4645-baa9-e2c67e61e468","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"LSP のプロトコルとしては全部送るやつと差分だけ送るやつがあって、クライアント・サーバーともにcapabilityで指定する感じだったような…気がします。\n私もサーバ側作るとき「こっちで差分からテキスト再構成するのめんどいからフルで送ってもらお」とかやったりするんですが、まあやっぱりパフォーマンスに悪影響あるんですね…","ts":"1615354617.061500","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1615354647.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hYj/D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a774caaf-7647-4b1a-a713-1880599dc76c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私もなんかもっとすごい差分送信なのかと思いました","ts":"1615354512.058100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A4f8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f99085f6-c088-4688-8641-3eeca3906ffb","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"むしろ今まで差分だけ送るの非対応だったんですねえ。知らなかった","ts":"1615354475.057600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D9ve3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38a0619e-d29c-4853-a0d9-9846097969aa","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim + vim-lsp です！","ts":"1615354085.056300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7TMPGWJ0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yfs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B8845C44-7237-4757-A324-C3429340301D","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"nvimでvim-lspってことですよね？Vim8もですか？","ts":"1615354015.055900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WGR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b0deb81-94fe-472a-b245-85702de0d88e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"僕は nvim-compe + 自作クライアントで使っているので恩恵はないです。（nvim-compe + vim-lsp だったり、nvim-compe + vim-lsc だったりも実はすでに使えます。）","ts":"1615353472.054700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j9rne"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52a2dbb0-5d45-4ab7-b92f-4ef58c33a567","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim-compe はほとんど全員が nvim-lsp との組み合わせなので、高速化を体感できると思いますおそらく！","ts":"1615353440.053900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":3,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01BY3SDBRS","UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4twlS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76bb796c-9a88-4d6f-ba81-e7f673ddbc11","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"redditユーザーcompeファン多いですよね。昨日も見つけた","ts":"1615353419.053400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WCsv3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6951f06-c49d-4097-9144-2662e7a68b9b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"coc/vim-lsp は semantic token とったり、folding とったり、ワークスペース対応してるので、もしかしたら LS のスキャン対象が多くなっていたりするはずです。","ts":"1615353395.053000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o9IH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8745c52-6f15-4cbc-9923-3263fc71591c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim-lsp が最速クラスというのは色々フェアではない言い方ではあるのですが（機能が少ないので）\nとはいえ、診断と補完が欲しいだけなんです〜って場合は最速だとは思いますｗ","ts":"1615353350.051900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1MqF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8db8956e-ce70-4e7b-ab15-1c8044197fe6","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"nvim の lsp が速くなったということは nvim-compe も更に超速になったということなのですね","ts":"1615353318.051200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sLz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9357f048-7420-4a62-bd34-3e40a9c58c09","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いいえ、coc/vim-lsp/vim-lsc/（自作のやつ）　基本的にみんながよく使うクライアントは全部対応していました。\nnvim-lsp だけが対応できていなかった。","ts":"1615353273.050600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cfAw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30cb7f38-99f8-4ac9-b937-1c963f5e9ecf","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まじで機能星取表ほしいですね・・・でかいやつだけでいいから・・・","ts":"1615353245.049500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8YS+L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cad43ae7-9cc2-49e4-8763-2c0c775717a0","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"LSPなにもわからない・・・それに対応してるのはlscとnvim-lspだけなんですね。んで、ワークスペースフォルダ（なにかは知らないですが）はnvim-lspが未対応。\ncocでまた最近更新され始めたLSP3.16はまた別で星取表作らないといけない感じですかね・・・？","ts":"1615353220.048900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gkFsn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1c64d64-1167-4350-9259-d2b9e1e1f379","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"この「通信時に毎回フルバッファを送る」が結構致命的だったんですよね。","ts":"1615353111.047200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g8Jhw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b060ef62-c006-4c65-9552-4a37bb3513ff","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"元々、なんか早いなって感じはあったのですが（多分ワークスペースフォルダに未対応だから。な気がしますが）","ts":"1615353092.046800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wYQ39"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94808860-0956-4a5f-bb2a-57dea46a1926","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ロジックとしては vim-lsc 由来のものを使っているという噂なので、これでパフォーマンスは最速クラスになったかもしれません。","ts":"1615352968.045700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":4,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U06ECBRTJ","U7JL1UKKL","UFP0GQZ4K"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4XZdm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c1af756-b318-40ef-a2a4-46364a70ca35","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim-lsp がついに LSP の差分 diff 送信に対応したようです。（これに対応していない場合、全てのテキスト編集時にフルバッファを送る必要があった。）","ts":"1615352922.045000","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1615352933.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":5,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U06ECBRTJ","UL6CFN8NR","U7JL1UKKL","UFP0GQZ4K"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iTU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe4128c8-f6fd-4e8b-8390-1aaab9ce8363","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私にはVim弄らないというのは無理だな","ts":"1615341500.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s90Dl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5330063-9da3-41ef-aa25-ac55fc2978dd","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"仕事中に.vimrcをいじることが最も会社に貢献することになるのならば、それは肯定されるのです。","ts":"1615341170.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UU2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5da00d5d-4123-47f4-b5d0-fafdf1443aa9","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"さすがにそこまで逸脱した事は自分はないはずですけど","ts":"1615341165.043200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01B7FN0XBK"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/E7Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"411358ea-d7a5-48f2-84a5-1bacf904638b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"「トラブルシュートのためにvimrc弄ってたと思ったらいつのまにかzshrc弄ってたことがない人だけが石を投げなさい」","ts":"1615341122.042300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7d8E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83e9e6cd-2944-466a-ba3f-bfa15f3754b0","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"そこはポリシーの問題なので、人それそれでいいと思いますけどｗ","ts":"1615341120.042100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p6c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37158485-a6f3-4350-8fd8-ad06c50ef8bd","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"\u0026gt; 基本的に仕事中にそういうトラブルシュートやvimrcいじりを一切しないという自分ルールを課しているので\nみんな心に刻むように！:boomerang:","ts":"1615341025.040300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MYaD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"357fa3e1-783d-48c3-ba2b-92cc5b2c05d7","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"なんだかんだnightly使っていると突然落ちることとかtree-sitterのSyntaxが壊れるなど仕事の停止を招く事態が発生することがあるからですね。基本的に仕事中にそういうトラブルシュートやvimrcいじりを一切しないという自分ルールを課しているので、仕事PCに入れるのはStableだけにしてます。","ts":"1615340748.038800","edited":{"user":"U80CX6XDZ","ts":"1615340833.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]},{"name":"syokunin","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"chXgV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1582b99f-6716-4853-89b1-dce0ec85c896","type":"message","user":"UFYACJ537","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/13875#issuecomment-794624990\u003e PRチャンスとはいえ動かなくなってつらいです…","ts":"1615338374.037900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZjQi2"}]}]
